{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"You follow your directions to a large red victorian house with white trim. There is a short cast iron fence around a small flower garden. Somehow when you approach the clouds always seem to dissipate, bathing the garden in warm summer’s light. The smells of home cooked food mixed with the scent of rose garden give a calming sensation. Auntie Mavis always greets you at the door with a smile and a plate full of cookies. The interior of the house is well kept, if a bit worn. She proudly displays a painting of King George above her mantle and is the very picture of a modern female business owner. Her door and gate are decorated with women’s suffrage posters and ribbons.","created_at":"2020-07-18T20:10:17.186000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734140006393839717","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
